    {
      "timestamp": 1790871306085,
      "source": "manual",
      "category": "conventions",
      "content": "Xbox 手柄配对后如果灯快闪但无法控制：\n\n1. 先用 `robotctl pad pair` 配对（不要直接用 bluetoothctl）\n2. 如果配对后灯还在闪，需要重连蓝牙：\n   ```bash\n   sudo bluetoothctl disconnect <手柄MAC>\n   sudo bluetoothctl connect <手柄MAC>\n   ```\n3. 连接成功后会出现 /dev/input/js0，xpadneo 驱动加载\n\n关键点：`robotctl pad pair` 只完成 BLE 配对，HID 连接可能需要额外 bluetoothctl 重连。"
    }
  ],
